    "basmil_image_text_list_qghLyP": {
      "type": "basmil-image-text-list",
      "blocks": {
        "content_LVX7tc": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Macronutrients",
            "description": "<p>Macronutrients are the type of nutrients that are required in large quantities for the growth and development of our body. Primarily we consume macronutrients like carbohydrates, proteins, and fats, which each contribute to bodily function on their own.</p><p>But only counting your macros is not enough if you don’t combine them with vital micronutrients. Your body simply won’t absorb it, meaning all your efforts of eating consciously with regard to macronutrients will go in vain. </p>",
            "did_you_know": "",
            "absorption_bioavailability": "",
            "dietary_sources": "",
            "image_type": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Macronutrients.webp",
            "image_alt": "Everest Shilajit",
            "svg": "",
            "image_width": "48%",
            "svg_style": ""
          }
        },
        "content_R4zELx": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Micronutrients",
            "description": "<p>The lesser-known nutrient class –  trace minerals are yet to be treated as equal, and with respect. Its deficiency is as damaging to your body as any major mineral deficiency. A diet isn’t truly healthy just because it meets your calorie goals. Nutrition goes well beyond simply counting calories or satisfying hunger.  </p><p>True health stems from a good mix of macronutrients and essential micronutrients working together, making your plate look like a colorful rainbow. </p>",
            "did_you_know": "",
            "absorption_bioavailability": "",
            "dietary_sources": "",
            "image_type": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/macronutrientss.webp",
            "image_alt": "Everest Shilajit",
            "svg": "",
            "image_width": "48%",
            "svg_style": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "content_LVX7tc",
        "content_R4zELx"
      ],
