          "settings": {
            "title": "Micro Trace Minerals",
            "subtitle": "",
            "description": "<p>Micro Trace Minerals are needed in smaller amounts but even there we miss the mark for their recommended daily consumption, here are such trace minerals that we need to think about including in our daily diets: </p>",
